1
00:00:00,095 --> 00:00:02,195
(Raj:)I'll get to celebrate
Diwali twice--

2
00:00:02,197 --> 00:00:03,767
(Raj:)one at each house.

3
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:08,137
(Raj:)That's double the Diwali.

4
00:00:09,237 --> 00:00:10,607
(Howard:)You sure you're okay?

5
00:00:10,605 --> 00:00:11,705
(Raj:)I'm okay.

6
00:00:11,706 --> 00:00:13,486
(Howard:)You don't look okay.

7
00:00:13,491 --> 00:00:15,271
(wails): How can I be okay?
I come from a broken home.

8
00:00:18,046 --> 00:00:20,546
(Leonard:)The doctor said I should be
out of surgery by 10:00.

9
00:00:20,549 --> 00:00:21,879
(Amy:)Okay.

10
00:00:21,883 --> 00:00:25,623
(Penny:)And Sheldon really believes
we're at a public swimming pool?

11
00:00:26,788 --> 00:00:30,058
(Leonard:)He was so busy figuring out
how many parts per million

12
00:00:30,058 --> 00:00:32,828
(Leonard:)of urine we'd be floating around
in, he didn't even question it.

13
00:00:34,062 --> 00:00:37,302
(Sheldon:)18 parts per million.

14
00:00:38,733 --> 00:00:40,933
(Sheldon:)And he's still doing it.

15
00:00:40,936 --> 00:00:43,466
(Amy:)Don't worry about that.
I'm happy to take you to work.

16
00:00:43,472 --> 00:00:44,802
(Sheldon:)Well, thank you.

17
00:00:44,806 --> 00:00:48,406
(Sheldon:)And Leonard never lets me have
French toast sticks in the car.

18
00:00:48,410 --> 00:00:50,580
(Sheldon:)I can't have syrupy fingers,

19
00:00:50,579 --> 00:00:53,349
(Sheldon:)but he can do the backstroke
in a toilet bowl.

20
00:00:54,749 --> 00:00:57,019
(Amy:)It's nice they're
getting exercise.

21
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:00,590
(Sheldon:)Although now that
I think about it,

